// UI strings for all eight serving languages.
//
// One flat dictionary: key -> {en, tr, de, fr, es, ar, zh, ru}. English is
// canonical and is what a missing key falls back to, so a partially
// translated key degrades to readable English rather than a blank. Product
// names (Global Monitor, Current Tension, Risk Simulator, Worldora,
// Worldora Intelligence, Geo Analysis Hub, BRICS+, USMCA, GDELT, World
// Bank, SIPRI) are deliberately NOT translated - they are brands or
// proper nouns and stay in their Latin/own-script form in every language.
//
// Data-owned strings (bloc names, metric names, risk criteria, scenario
// text, country names) are NOT here: those come from the API, localized by
// backend/src/global_monitor/i18n.py.
